{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 16, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "* **Alex:** *\"Oh my god, I can’t believe we’re actually going to this thing.\" (straightening the sequined bodice of their ball gown, which sparkles even under the dim porch light) \"Do you have any idea how hard it was to find shoes that match this *without* killing my feet? Also—why does it suddenly feel like 90 degrees in here?\"*\n\n  **Jamie:** *\"Dude, you look like you’re going to a royal ball, not just some random gallery opening in the city.\"* (adjusting the hood of their oversized sweatshirt, ignoring the crumbs on the sleeve) *\"Honestly, I’m surprised you didn’t bring a tiara. Or a fan. Jesus, it’s just a night of weird art and free wine. You couldn’t wear, like, a cute dress?\"*\n\n---\n\n* **Alex:** *\"A cute dress? Jamie, this gown is *not* cute—it’s *historic*. It’s got lace so delicate it probably cost more than your rent. And don’t act like you don’t know the second I walk in, half the people there will be staring. You’re lucky you get to hide in the background like a normal person.\"* (smoothes a hand over the skirt, then winces) *\"Ugh, I hope the venue has an elevator. I don’t wanna drag this thing down stairs.\"*\n\n  **Jamie:** *\"Wow, so *that’s* why you made me come. For the *aesthetic*?\"* (kicks off their sneakers, wiggling toes) *\"Look, just roll up the sleeves and tie it back like you’re about to paint the Sistine Chapel. Problem solved. Also, I packed ibuprofen. For theHeaders—\"*\n\n---\n\n* **Alex:** *\"Headers? What are you even talking about?\"* (grabbling the edge of the gown to sit down—then immediately freezes) *\"Oh, *no*, no, no, the train! Jamie, I swear to god if I rip the hem—\"* (suddenly spots Jamie’s phone screen glowing with a meme) *\"Wait, is that the event’s Instagram? Did you *already* post?!\"*\n\n  **Jamie:** *\"Relax, it’s just a ‘get ready with’ story. Said we’re ‘opposites attracting’ or some crap.\"* (taps the screen, then shoves the phone back in their pocket with a smirk) *\"Also, someone sent you a DM. Says you have a ‘regal presence’ and they’d love to ‘discuss your outfit later.’\"* (snorts) *\"Bet they’re a bot.\"*\n\n  **Alex:** *\"…It’s *not* a bot.\"* (grabs their clutch, suddenly upright) *\"Alright, let’s go. But if one person asks me where I got this dress, I’m throwing you into the fountain out front.\"*", "logprobs": [{"token": "*", "logprob": -0.15976127982139587}, {"token": " **", "logprob": -0.7903324961662292}, {"token": "Alex", "logprob": -1.954728603363037}, {"token": ":**", "logprob": -1.0355175733566284}, {"token": " *\"", "logprob": -1.7491363286972046}, {"token": "Oh", "logprob": -2.843580722808838}, {"token": " my", "logprob": -0.12014979869127274}, {"token": " god", "logprob": -1.4445109367370605}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.03765276446938515}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -2.468191146850586}, {"token": " can", "logprob": -0.5545154809951782}, {"token": "’t", "logprob": -0.0505123995244503}, {"token": " believe", "logprob": -0.03501706197857857}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -1.1274049282073975}, {"token": "’re", "logprob": -0.023531805723905563}, {"token": " actually", "logprob": -0.311950147151947}, {"token": " going", "logprob": -0.985730767250061}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.33202213048934937}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -0.30398136377334595}, {"token": " thing", "logprob": -0.28139567375183105}, {"token": ".\"", "logprob": -5.341038703918457}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -2.4794740676879883}, {"token": "stra", "logprob": -5.129525661468506}, {"token": "ight", "logprob": -0.00713349087163806}, {"token": "ening", "logprob": -0.7597353458404541}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.49305808544158936}, {"token": " sequ", "logprob": -2.0316367149353027}, {"token": "ined", "logprob": -0.7780811190605164}, {"token": " bod", "logprob": -1.452017903327942}, {"token": "ice", "logprob": -0.0007565735140815377}, {"token": " 